                                            No. 2: To consider and approve by an ordinary resolution that, immediately following the
                                            Current Share Consolidation, subject to the Current Share Consolidation being approved, the
                                            authorized share capital of the Company be increased either, depending on the result of the
                                            Current Share Consolidation:</FONT></P></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-right: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

